There was one game that did make it out the door for a super Nintendo and Sega Genesis called Outlander, but it, uh, was like pitched as a Mad Max video game.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:32.460
But instead, uh, they had to like, they couldn't get the license.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.240
