00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:38.040
And obviously like the game is spiritually in the same vein.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:42.180
It is a vehicular combat game, but just no actual references.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.340
What game was that?

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:47.320
Outlander. It's, um, it's like a 16 bit followup.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:53.720
So if you have any interest in, you know, you played this version of Mad Max and wanted to see where they would take it.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.740
Outlander would be the one to check out.

