00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:32.620
Rage, definitely.

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:41.020
Rage, um, I would say matches up more with like the Fury Road and later feel.

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:48.560
Because the vehicles are crazy and it has the punks, you know, with the, all, you know, all the, uh, battle gear on.

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:50.020
But no, I agree. Yeah.

00:22:51.120 --> 00:23:03.900
Um. Uh, so was that Mad Max 2015 video game, since you're, uh, the unfortunate expert of it on this episode, uh, was that anything like, um, like, it was before Fury Road, right?

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:05.620
