00:25:45.560 --> 00:25:47.000
We have to make a Mad Max N64 game.

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:48.200
It's like, it never happened.

00:25:48.200 --> 00:25:49.820
It didn't continue that trend.

00:25:50.020 --> 00:25:50.900
It was funny.

00:25:51.540 --> 00:25:56.360
