00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:19.160
Not as crazy as we've had in the past.

00:26:19.180 --> 00:26:20.540
Of, like, it's 1990.

00:26:20.540 --> 00:26:22.200
Why are we making a Mad Max game?

00:26:22.200 --> 00:26:24.820
In the same way of, like, it's 1990.

00:26:24.820 --> 00:26:27.400
